# Open this file in VS Code with REST Client, then click "Send Request".
# Start server.js first. Categories and roadmap also need Floci + seeded tables.
@api = http://localhost:3001

### Express is listening. Expect 200 and service "roadmap".
GET {{api}}/health

### Read seeded categories. Expect 200 and seven items.
GET {{api}}/api/categories

### Board, newest first. Expect 200 and four named columns.
GET {{api}}/api/roadmap?sort=newest

### Filter one column. Its items array may be empty.
GET {{api}}/api/features?status=under_review&category=ui-ux

### Status is required for a single column. Expect 400.
GET {{api}}/api/features

### Creating a request requires login. Expect 401.
POST {{api}}/api/features
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Export roadmap",
  "description": "Download the public roadmap as a file.",
  "categoryId": "reporting"
}

### My submissions. Set userJwt in the private REST Client environment.
GET {{api}}/api/me/features
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

### Decline an Under Review request. Supply private adminJwt and a test featureId locally.
PATCH {{api}}/api/features/{{featureId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"declined","reason":"Outside this product's scope"}
